<title>UK: Eurofima sets 3.0 billion Lux franc 8-year bond.</title>
<headline>Eurofima sets 3.0 billion Lux franc 8-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banque Bruxelles Lambert and Credit Europeen.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROFIMA</p>
<p> AMT    3.0 BLN LUF   COUPON     5.75	MATURITY    20.DEC.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.50    PAY DATE 19/20.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    =	   YIELD	 5.36</p>
<p> LISTING     LUX     DENOMS (K) 50-250    GOV LAW     LUX</p>
<p> PRAECIPUUM  0.175</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
